
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.02699165 0.014814739 -0.085167988) to (82.069008 81.239152 84.397168)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
